work_units.notes:
Enforce the intersected query set across columns and state its size on the page. A query missing a pass in any column is shown as unrecorded in that column and excluded from every column's geomean.

Add tests pinning:
  - a query missing one pass changes every column's geomean denominator identically;
  - the stated query-set size matches the denominator actually used;
  - a column whose basis the run cannot answer reports unavailable rather than substituting;
  - the warmup penalty is absent, not estimated, when no warmup was recorded.

This is the case that produced a wrong 1.18x reading in the design prototype before the intersection was applied; the test must fail if the intersection is removed.
